MODULE: ShutdownTerminalReparksWriter
TARGET: ShutdownTerminal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: shutdown leaves the producer parked on saturation
PERTURBS: ShutdownDrain

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.writer = IF shuttingDown' THEN "shutdown" ELSE @,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: retain a saturation park after shutdown.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.writer = @,
--- END
